{
  "_README": [
    "FlashAttention-3 (hopper/) at a pinned commit: the subset gqa_sm90 compiles, byte-identical to upstream except the rewrite rules below.",
    "The file list is the include closure of the translation units in gqa_sm90/_extension.py (SOURCES) under its build profile.",
    "upstream_sha256 records the upstream files the copy was taken from, as citation; it is not compared with an installed or checked-out upstream. vendored_sha256 detects local edits (tests/test_vendor_cpu.py). To update, copy the listed files from upstream at upstream.commit, apply rewrite_rules, and requalify (gqa_sm90/tests/test_ops_gpu.py, test_seam_gpu.py).",
    "LICENSE and AUTHORS are the repository-root files, stored with a .txt suffix so the wheel carries them.",
    "isoexec_edits lists upstream files IsoExec modified for the segment split (spec.SEG_RECIPE); isoexec_files lists files IsoExec added (upstream_sha256 null). Every other file is byte-identical to upstream except the rewrite rules."
  ],
  "upstream": {
    "repo": "https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention",
    "commit": "e81a70ce92d6dd96e213c08adbadd7c7e3d17f01",
    "subdirectory": "hopper",
    "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
    "cutlass_submodule": "7127592069c2fe01b041e174ba4345ef9b279671",
    "cutlass_note": "Built against isoexec.ops.build_cache.CUTLASS_REVISION (147f5673), which differs from FA3's submodule only in copyright years, one constexpr keyword position, an unused '(void) workspace;' and CUTLASS_PATCH 4->5; the kernel SASS was identical when this was recorded (the comparison script that measured it has since been removed).",
    "captured": "2026-11-06"
  },
  "rewrite_rules": [
    {
      "file": "flash_api_stable.cpp",
      "old": "STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY(flash_attn_3, m) {",
      "new": "STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY(isoexec_gqa_sm90, m) {",
      "why": "own operator namespace, so the vendored library never collides with an installed flash_attn_3"
    },
    {
      "file": "flash_api_stable.cpp",
      "old": "STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(flash_attn_3, CUDA, m) {",
      "new": "STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(isoexec_gqa_sm90, CUDA, m) {",
      "why": "same"
    }
  ],
